      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tule_Springs"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Upper Las Vegas Wash, which feeds into the Las Vegas Wash, also harbors rare patches of Las Vegas bear poppy.",
